210 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The PCB Defect Detection and Classification Application was successfully developed using computer vision and deep learning techniques. The system was trained and tested using the DeepPCB dataset, which includes multiple categories of PCB defects such as Missing Hole, Mouse Bite, Open Circuit, Short, Spur, and Spurious Copper. The main objective was to automate the defect detection process and achieve high classification accuracy using an optimized deep learning model.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
