/E (MODEL TRAINING AND PERFORMANCE :)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
212 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The EfficientNet-B4 architecture was implemented in PyTorch for defect classification due to its high performance and efficient parameter utilization. The dataset was divided into 80% training and 20% validation sets . The model was trained for 9 epochs using the Adam optimizer and Cross-Entropy loss function.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
endobj
