/T (The trained model was integrated into a web-based application developed using Streamlit. Users can upload PCB images, and the system automatically detects, classifies, and annotates defect regions. The application generates real-time visual output with bounding boxes around defects and provides an option to export annotated results and prediction logs. Testing on multiple unseen PCB samples confirmed that the system operates with an average inference time of less than 5 seconds per image, making it highly suitable for production environments.)
